  moving:'Programs of record are buying in volume: the Army’s 2,500-drone Skydio order, Red Cat’s Black Widow (a 5,880-system objective, subject to change). New models now need Blue UAS listing, Buy American status or an FCC conditional approval.',
  src:['https://www.skydio.com/blog/u-s-army-usd52-million-order-skydio-x10d','https://ir.redcatholdings.com/news-events/press-releases/detail/160/red-cat-announces-production-selection-for-u-s-army-short-range-reconnaissance-program'],
